this was the moment a passenger plane  careered off the end of a runway  breaking into three pieces the aircraft  stopped just short of a busy road it was  carrying a hundred and seventy seven  passengers from Izmir province to  Istanbul Turkish authorities say the  majority of those on board survived  unfortunately the Pegasus Airlines plane  couldn't hold on to the runway  due to poor weather conditions and  skidded for around 60 meters it fell  from this area from around 40 meters  height 175 passengers two babies for  flight attendants and two pilots were  all 120 passengers were transferred to  nearby this comes just a month after  another Pegasus Airlines plane came off  the runway at the same effort  dozens of emergency workers were at the  scene dousing the flames and evacuating  passengers the plane had had to land in  heavy wind and rain those on board  climbed through large cracks in its side  to escape  most of the passengers have been taken  to hospital for treatment as Turkish  authorities work to establish how  another plane skidded off this busy  runway alle food skew Sky News
 

